  "tier": "culture",
  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Fused Celtic-Japonic ladder, ascending; the titles blend the two (Celtic aire/tigern/flaith/ri + Japonic jito/shugo/daimyo/o/tenno). Aijito (land-lord) barony; Maorsaki (border-warden) march; Tigosho (province-lord) county; Flaimyo (great-lord) duchy; Rikoshu (prince) principality; Ruirio (king) kingdom; Ardtenno (high-sovereign) empire over Ardtenka. The brithem-code and the honor-bound clans order the realm. (Rank titles fuse the real Gaelic/Japanese register, allowed.)",
    "approved_foreign_terms_used": [
      "Daimyo (duchy)",
      "Shogun (kingdom)"
    ],
